{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": 0.08,
      "end_seconds": 2.341,
      "text": "Before ChatGPT took the world by storm,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 2.741,
      "end_seconds": 4.482,
      "text": "the team behind its future rival made a"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 4.522,
      "end_seconds": 7.724,
      "text": "surprising choice: they held their own chatbot back."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 8.644,
      "end_seconds": 10.205,
      "text": "One of them was Dario Amodei."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 10.725,
      "end_seconds": 12.806,
      "text": "He had worked on AI models at OpenAI,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 13.106,
      "end_seconds": 15.087,
      "text": "then left and co-founded a new company:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 15.487,
      "end_seconds": 18.429,
      "text": "Anthropic. As his team developed an early version"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 18.449,
      "end_seconds": 20.65,
      "text": "of Claude, they worried that releasing it could"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 20.69,
      "end_seconds": 21.75,
      "text": "spark an AI race."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 22.39,
      "end_seconds": 24.191,
      "text": "If companies rushed to outdo one another,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 24.551,
      "end_seconds": 26.212,
      "text": "would they have enough time to make powerful"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 26.272,
      "end_seconds": 29.034,
      "text": "systems safe? So Anthropic waited."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 29.654,
      "end_seconds": 31.415,
      "text": "Then, in November 2022,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 31.915,
      "end_seconds": 34.176,
      "text": "OpenAI released ChatGPT to the public."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 34.716,
      "end_seconds": 36.877,
      "text": "Anthropic introduced Claude the following March."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 37.578,
      "end_seconds": 40.539,
      "text": "Years later, Amodei said waiting had probably cost"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 40.599,
      "end_seconds": 42.52,
      "text": "Anthropic the chance to lead in AI for"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 42.64,
      "end_seconds": 43.4,
      "text": "everyday users."
    }
  ]
}
